## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: WOWFTrackerDB, ChairIgnoreCharDB

# The SavedVariables names above are deliberately NOT renamed to match the
# display names. They are what the client keys the saved file by: renaming them
# drops the data.

# Shared libraries, for other addons' data feeds on the OSD. Each one checks
# its version with LibStub, so another addon's copy of the same library is fine.
Libs\LibStub\LibStub.lua
Libs\CallbackHandler-1.0\CallbackHandler-1.0.lua
Libs\LibDataBroker-1.1\LibDataBroker-1.1.lua
Libs\LibDeflate\LibDeflate.lua
Libs\LibSerialize\LibSerialize.lua

